---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About the Keiter & Co. Academy, about the curriculum, and about Olivia and Alex Keiter."
>
  <section class="section bg-warm-white border-b border-stone/20">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-moss uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">About</p>
      <h1 class="mb-4">About the academy.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About the curriculum -->
  <section class="section border-b border-stone/20">
    <div class="container max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="mb-4">What this is</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-bark/80">
        <p>
          The Keiter &amp; Co. Academy is a public, self-paced curriculum that teaches a new operator how to run a Keiter &amp; Co. build from zero. Starting point is no AI exposure. Ending point is operating a complete client engagement using the Keiter methodology: intake, three-document workflow, build, launch, Welcome to the Family guide, and ongoing Care Plan support.
        </p>
        <p>
          The academy doubles as Olivia's personal reference and as a shareable artifact for future hires, contractors, and the public.
        </p>
        <p>
          This build follows the Keiter methodology in its own construction. Three documents, multi-phase kickoff, full Definition of Done checklist, WCAG 2.2 AA, SEO and AEO, online personality. The academy site is itself a worked example future operators can read alongside the Outpost Vending build.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Olivia -->
  <section class="section border-b border-stone/20">
    <div class="container max-w-3xl">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
        <!-- Photo placeholder -->
        <div
          class="w-36 h-36 rounded-full bg-mauve-faint shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-stone text-xs italic text-center p-2"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <!-- BUILDNOTES: Replace with real portrait. Subject: Olivia, warm lighting, 1:1 aspect ratio. -->
          Photo: Olivia portrait, 1:1
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2">Olivia Keiter</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-moss mb-4">Co-founder, Keiter &amp; Co. LLC</p>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-bark/80">
            <p>
              Olivia runs the builds. She developed the Keiter methodology over years of working with small businesses, refining an approach that is practical, accessible, and grounded in genuine care for the people and communities the work serves.
            </p>
            <p>
              The academy captures what she knows and makes it transferable. That is the whole goal.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Keiter & Co. -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="mb-4">About Keiter &amp; Co.</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-bark/80">
        <p>
          Keiter &amp; Co. is a small web design and build practice based in upstate New York. We build sites for local businesses, care plans for ongoing clients, and now, a curriculum that teaches the whole methodology to anyone who wants to learn it.
        </p>
        <p>
          The work is grounded in five standing principles, a set of hard formatting rules, and a genuine belief that building for people you know and care about produces better work than building for anyone who will pay.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="https://keiterandco.com" class="text-moss hover:text-rust">keiterandco.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs text-stone mt-10">About page last reviewed: 2026-05-09</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
